config BR2_PACKAGE_STOCK_FIRMWARE
	bool "stock-firmware"
	help
	  From the stock firmware: the vendor U-Boot FIT (mtd1), whose
	  BL31, OP-TEE and control tree the card's U-Boot carries, and
	  the RTL8733BU's Bluetooth firmware, which has no other source.
	  Set STOCK_FIRMWARE_OVERRIDE_SRCDIR to a directory holding
	  uboot.img and stock-harvest.tar from your own dump.
